      "sourceTextSha256": "ff7e0b2ef3f53dd828b114ad419aaefcf25a07f0e7fc4c38f7114681f42d6345",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Full-day “Great Circle” excursion with an English-speaking guide and private transport. Follow the Limay River valley to the Amphitheatre viewpoint, 35 km from the hotel, overlooking rivers and peninsulas, then continue among rock formations towards Cuyín Manzano. Reach the Traful viewpoint over Lake Traful and the village of Villa Traful, ideal for lunch, tea or local chocolates, then Villa La Angostura, on Lake Correntoso, before returning to Bariloche.",
