      "sourceTextSha256": "9655431d98e8b213d8bf72907377a14ab6be879dfd2f6aed7bb8550b268df057",
      "text": "Panoramic tour of about 65 km by car. Stop at Playa Bonita, facing Huemul Island, then go up Cerro Campanario (1,050 m) for an unforgettable view of Lakes Moreno and Nahuel Huapi, El Trébol Lagoon, the San Pedro and Llao Llao peninsulas, Victoria Island and the peaks of Otto, López, Goye and Cerro Catedral.",
